# App R8 rules (AGP merges every *.keep in src/main/keepRules). Library consumer rules cover
# Hilt, Room, kotlinx.serialization, OkHttp, Coil, pdfbox; @JavascriptInterface methods are kept by
# the default proguard-android-optimize.txt rules.

# pdfbox-android: optional JPEG2000 decoder (separate jp2-android artifact) is not bundled; JPX images just fail.
-dontwarn com.gemalto.jp2.**
